WEBVTT

00:03.350 --> 00:06.020
<b>Better hurry, or we'll lose
the Magic Sword of Destruction!</b>

00:06.270 --> 00:11.650
<b>We just need to find Avos Dilhevia, right?
But how can we get Misa back—</b>

00:11.650 --> 00:12.490
<b>Hold on.</b>

01:49.830 --> 01:53.880
<b>06 - THE GREAT SPIRIT MOTHER
AND THE DEMON KING'S RIGHT-HAND MAN</b>

01:59.260 --> 02:03.430
<b>Don't let your guard down.
They could have already gotten in!</b>

02:03.760 --> 02:05.180
<b>- Yes, ma'am!
- Shua.</b>

02:11.560 --> 02:13.440
<b>Nothing's amiss. Next.</b>

02:14.690 --> 02:16.280
<b><i>Revest and Menou, eh?</i></b>

02:18.780 --> 02:20.570
<b><i>The misfit's symbol.</i></b>

02:21.200 --> 02:22.620
<b><i>This may be a trap.</i></b>

02:22.620 --> 02:23.530
<b><i>It's all right.</i></b>

02:24.160 --> 02:25.120
<b><i>He's angry.</i></b>

02:25.910 --> 02:26.910
<b><i>I see.</i></b>

02:31.580 --> 02:32.960
<b>Is there a problem?</b>

02:32.960 --> 02:36.510
<b>No. Let me sweep this area a little longer.</b>

02:36.510 --> 02:38.800
<b>I've already checked it.
No insurgents here.</b>

02:38.920 --> 02:42.300
<b>But they may have left some traces.</b>

02:42.970 --> 02:44.050
<b>Lady Luche...</b>

02:44.310 --> 02:46.350
<b>They would've left footprints here.</b>

02:46.600 --> 02:49.310
<b>Don't you think it would
be worthwhile to investigate?</b>

02:49.770 --> 02:51.730
<b>Then I'm leaving it to you two.</b>

02:52.060 --> 02:54.980
<b>- The rest of you, search down below.
- Yes, ma'am!</b>

03:00.530 --> 03:01.530
<b>Is that you, Anos?</b>

03:05.700 --> 03:07.790
<b>I knew that you'd notice this!</b>

03:08.120 --> 03:10.580
<b>Thank goodness you're safe, Anos!</b>

03:10.580 --> 03:12.000
<b>I'm glad that you're safe, too.</b>

03:12.370 --> 03:16.960
<b>Most of the Royals are under Demera's spell.
Even Lord Meleheyth...</b>

03:17.250 --> 03:20.840
<b>The children in white have been locked up
as Magic Power nourishment.</b>

03:21.220 --> 03:24.430
<b>We've got to do something
about Avos Dilhevia right away.</b>

03:24.430 --> 03:26.850
<b>I need to take care of two things first.</b>

03:27.600 --> 03:30.310
<b>The masked demon
who calls himself the Spirit King,</b>

03:30.310 --> 03:35.230
<b>NousGalia, who took over Erdomaid's body,
along with Avos Dilhevia...</b>

03:35.230 --> 03:38.150
<b>I want to know where those three are.
Am I being clear?</b>

03:38.400 --> 03:40.070
<b>I'll look into that right away.</b>

03:40.070 --> 03:41.490
<b>What's the other thing?</b>

03:41.490 --> 03:45.740
<b>I'm going to use the ultimate Time Magic,
Revalon, in the treasure house ahead.</b>

03:45.740 --> 03:46.950
<b>Revalon?</b>

03:46.950 --> 03:48.790
<b>There's something I want to investigate, see.</b>

03:49.080 --> 03:52.040
<b>What exactly are you going
to investigate using Time Magic?</b>

03:52.040 --> 03:54.290
<b>First off, the Great Spirit Leno.</b>

03:54.290 --> 03:56.250
<b>Why did she end up dying?</b>

03:56.250 --> 03:58.090
<b>The other is the Spirit King.</b>

03:58.090 --> 04:02.510
<b>Most likely, he's Shin, but I want
to know what happened to him.</b>

04:02.760 --> 04:06.720
<b>And finally, Misa.
I want to know how she was created.</b>

04:07.560 --> 04:09.470
<b>When a half-spirit, half-demon is born,</b>

04:09.470 --> 04:13.060
<b>half of her Source is made up
of brand new rumors and legends.</b>

04:13.270 --> 04:17.440
<b>Misa's Source is based
on Avos Dilhevia's rumors.</b>

04:17.440 --> 04:19.780
<b>Those were generated 2,000 years ago.</b>

04:19.780 --> 04:23.400
<b>Spread by the Hero Kanon after I was reincarnated.</b>

04:23.820 --> 04:27.530
<b>Meaning that Misa must
have been born 2,000 years ago.</b>

04:27.530 --> 04:30.910
<b>But she only has 15 years' worth of memories.</b>

04:30.910 --> 04:33.620
<b>I'm sure she doesn't know
a thing about the Mythical Age.</b>

04:33.830 --> 04:36.130
<b>There has to be a reason for that.</b>

04:36.130 --> 04:37.840
<b>The same goes for Shin.</b>

04:37.840 --> 04:41.800
<b>Why did he become the Spirit King,
and grow hostile towards me?</b>

04:42.340 --> 04:44.090
<b>He was trying to protect Misa?</b>

04:44.470 --> 04:46.050
<b>Possibly.</b>

04:46.050 --> 04:48.930
<b>If the rumors and legends surrounding
the Demon King of Tyranny cease to exist,</b>

04:48.930 --> 04:52.560
<b>Misa will come down with Spirit Plague,
and eventually vanish.</b>

04:53.020 --> 04:57.020
<b>That's why Avos Dilhevia appeared
at the Magic Sword Tournament in disguise,</b>

04:57.230 --> 04:59.230
<b>and concealed Lay's plan.</b>

05:00.320 --> 05:04.320
<b>The strong link between Shin
and Misa is the Great Spirit Leno.</b>

05:04.650 --> 05:07.490
<b>It was likely her death
that set everything in motion.</b>

05:07.820 --> 05:11.330
<b>I'm going to go back in time 2,000 years,
and find out for sure.</b>

05:11.580 --> 05:16.040
<b>But even if you add the Spirit God Sword, it won't
be enough to send you back 2,000 years, will it?</b>

05:16.290 --> 05:18.630
<b>That's why I'm heading to the treasure house.</b>

05:19.210 --> 05:22.800
<b>I acquired a scythe when I defended
the Guardian God of Time, see.</b>

05:23.630 --> 05:28.680
<b>Combining that and our Magic Power just might
be enough to send me back 2,000 years.</b>

05:29.010 --> 05:32.430
<b>But as Revalon requires massive amounts
of Magic Power,</b>

05:32.430 --> 05:34.310
<b>it can't be hidden with Najira.</b>

05:34.680 --> 05:39.020
<b>To ensure that the Demons don't catch on,
we'll have to separate them as much as possible.</b>

05:39.520 --> 05:41.650
<b>A way to separate them...</b>

05:42.940 --> 05:43.980
<b>There is one.</b>

05:44.240 --> 05:47.150
<b>Please use attack magic on me.</b>

05:47.150 --> 05:49.990
<b>As flashy as possible...
something that can't be healed.</b>

05:50.320 --> 05:54.370
<b>Right. But it will be more painful
than anything you've ever felt before.</b>

05:54.620 --> 05:57.330
<b>Wait! I can't let you do that to my student—</b>

05:57.330 --> 05:59.790
<b>We'll never deceive them otherwise!</b>

06:02.210 --> 06:05.670
<b>Fine. Let's not let this resolve be for nothing.</b>

06:05.970 --> 06:07.470
<b>That's the spirit.</b>

06:09.130 --> 06:10.430
<b>I trust you're ready.</b>

06:11.470 --> 06:12.760
<b>Degzegd.</b>

06:21.560 --> 06:24.020
<b>I'm going to go easy on you.
You won't perish.</b>

06:41.000 --> 06:41.670
<b>What's going on?</b>

06:42.210 --> 06:45.380
<b>It's Anos Voldigoad! He and his subordinates
are heading for the upper floors!</b>

06:49.590 --> 06:52.010
<b>A curse so strong
it can't be healed with magic?</b>

06:55.140 --> 06:58.680
<b><i>- The misfit has arrived. Head upstairs!
- Yes, ma'am!</i></b>

06:59.770 --> 07:02.900
<b>You come with me, too.
You can revive him later.</b>

07:05.320 --> 07:06.230
<b>Very well.</b>

07:18.250 --> 07:21.420
<b>I can't heal your wounds just yet.</b>

07:21.920 --> 07:23.630
<b>R-Right...</b>

07:23.960 --> 07:28.880
<b>Who knew that you wouldn't fall for Demera
despite believing in the Demon King of Tyranny.</b>

07:29.220 --> 07:31.340
<b>That's precisely... why.</b>

07:32.180 --> 07:35.010
<b>The Demon King of Tyranny that I believed in...</b>

07:35.430 --> 07:39.100
<b>Obtained his powers so that he could protect the weak!</b>

07:39.600 --> 07:44.360
<b>Avos Dilhevia... someone like him
who would stoop to such vile tactics...</b>

07:44.360 --> 07:47.440
<b>...there's no way that he could
be our founding ancestor!</b>

07:47.900 --> 07:53.360
<b>That's true. Avos Dilhevia doesn't stand
a chance against even a misfit like myself.</b>

07:53.360 --> 07:55.070
<b>And I'm going to prove it.</b>

08:04.920 --> 08:05.580
<b>Let's go.</b>

08:06.380 --> 08:08.300
<b>Demon King... my lord...</b>

08:08.840 --> 08:14.390
<b>My crewmates... my classmates...</b>

08:14.390 --> 08:18.600
<b>Leave it to me.
I'll make your wish come true.</b>

08:24.940 --> 08:26.900
<b>No Demons nearby.</b>

08:26.900 --> 08:28.360
<b>Now's our chance!</b>

08:28.360 --> 08:29.020
<b>Yes.</b>

08:29.360 --> 08:31.690
<b>If you do make it back 2,000 years with Revalon,</b>

08:31.690 --> 08:33.610
<b>then all you have to do
is change history, I guess?</b>

08:33.610 --> 08:36.570
<b>Unfortunately, it's not that simple.</b>

08:37.030 --> 08:40.410
<b>If there are any significant conflicts between
the existing past and present,</b>

08:40.410 --> 08:42.120
<b>then history can't be modified.</b>

08:42.410 --> 08:43.870
<b>So you're only going to look around?</b>

08:44.170 --> 08:47.710
<b>Yes. I'm going to find out what happened
to Shin and the others.</b>

08:47.710 --> 08:49.380
<b>That's the most I can do, probably.</b>

09:27.290 --> 09:28.630
<b>Shin, what's wrong?</b>

09:30.380 --> 09:31.170
<b>Nothing.</b>

09:44.980 --> 09:47.310
<b>Wow! This is Gairadite!</b>

09:47.310 --> 09:49.900
<b>It's different than usual.</b>

09:53.070 --> 09:56.490
<b>From the looks of the city,
it's almost certainly 2,000 years ago.</b>

09:56.490 --> 09:57.860
<b>But I wonder when, exactly?</b>

09:57.860 --> 09:59.570
<b>It's right after I was reincarnated.</b>

09:59.820 --> 10:01.870
<b>Why did we come here?</b>

10:01.870 --> 10:04.410
<b>Because the rumors about
Aharthern in this era were:</b>

10:04.410 --> 10:08.500
<b>"On the night of the hazy moon,
mist will rise on Lake Holy Light's shore.</b>

10:08.500 --> 10:13.050
<b>If you toss a water-colored candy,
it will open up the path to the forest."</b>

10:13.050 --> 10:14.710
<b>Then it must be close by.</b>

10:15.090 --> 10:17.220
<b>Leno should be returning soon.</b>

10:17.510 --> 10:19.510
<b>Shin is accompanying her under my orders.</b>

10:19.510 --> 10:22.640
<b>But you have the power
to find out where they are, don't you?</b>

10:22.640 --> 10:26.810
<b>If I use too much Magic Power,
the people of this era might notice.</b>

10:26.810 --> 10:30.600
<b>But no matter what you do in the past,
it won't change history, right?</b>

10:30.600 --> 10:36.110
<b>To be specific, after Revalon ends,
the Gods of Time will restore it.</b>

10:36.110 --> 10:38.150
<b>The insignificant things
will remain the same.</b>

10:39.280 --> 10:42.740
<b>Still, if we're too flamboyant,
there's no telling what might happen.</b>

10:42.950 --> 10:47.290
<b>If that's the case, then you being here
might be the biggest issue of all.</b>

10:47.290 --> 10:49.420
<b>Since you'd already been reincarnated by this time.</b>

10:50.500 --> 10:53.920
<b>For now, I want to use your Magic Power
to conceal my Source.</b>

10:55.250 --> 10:56.130
<b>All right.</b>

11:02.090 --> 11:04.640
<b>And now I can just conceal myself using Lynel.</b>

11:05.010 --> 11:08.350
<b>The moon will be hazy tonight.
We can test the rumor.</b>

11:08.640 --> 11:11.730
<b>I'm glad it's not "make the fairies laugh" again!</b>

11:11.980 --> 11:14.610
<b>Is that "water-colored candy"
Holy Light Candy, I wonder?</b>

11:14.610 --> 11:16.650
<b>That's my favorite!</b>

11:16.980 --> 11:20.740
<b>There should be food stalls in the city.
Let's go shopping for some.</b>

11:24.660 --> 11:26.490
<b>So many people...</b>

11:26.830 --> 11:29.460
<b>I went back to Axeshion right away, remember.</b>

11:29.660 --> 11:33.210
<b>So this is the Hero Kanon's victory party
for having defeated the Demon King.</b>

11:33.210 --> 11:37.880
<b>How can you be so happy to see people celebrating
the person who defeated you?</b>

11:37.880 --> 11:38.960
<b>You mean me?</b>

11:38.960 --> 11:41.010
<b>- You were smiling.
- Hmm.</b>

11:41.300 --> 11:45.510
<b>It's not that I'm happy, but I do find it worthwhile
to have been brought down.</b>

11:45.850 --> 11:49.180
<b>I see. Personally, I find it a little annoying.</b>

11:52.140 --> 11:54.400
<b>Hey, found it!
The Holy Light Candy.</b>

11:54.690 --> 11:58.320
<b>Is there enough for me to eat?</b>

11:58.320 --> 12:00.030
<b>- Eleonore.
- Huh?</b>

12:00.030 --> 12:02.950
<b>I brought these from the treasure house.
Use them.</b>

12:02.950 --> 12:03.610
<b>Wow!</b>

12:03.990 --> 12:05.700
<b>We can live the good life now!</b>

12:07.660 --> 12:08.790
<b>Welcome!</b>

12:08.790 --> 12:11.250
<b>Hey, mister, I want to buy some Holy Light Candy.</b>

12:11.250 --> 12:12.160
<b>How many?</b>

12:12.460 --> 12:14.880
<b>Um... do you have ten?</b>

12:14.880 --> 12:15.670
<b>Coming up!</b>

12:18.170 --> 12:20.420
<b>This is the last of it.</b>

12:20.420 --> 12:21.840
<b>I'm throwing one in for free!</b>

12:22.050 --> 12:23.930
<b>Thanks mister!</b>

12:23.930 --> 12:25.680
<b>Thank you... very much.</b>

12:27.140 --> 12:28.680
<b>Hey, over there!</b>

12:29.350 --> 12:31.230
<b>Found it! The Holy Light Candy!</b>

12:32.640 --> 12:34.730
<b>Please try not to wander away from me.</b>

12:34.730 --> 12:37.480
<b>If something happens,
I might not be able to handle it.</b>

12:37.480 --> 12:39.570
<b>If they're all sold out,
it will be your fault, Shin!</b>

12:39.900 --> 12:41.900
<b>Running makes it even more distracting for me.</b>

12:44.150 --> 12:48.120
<b>Keep your mask on! If they find out
you're a Demon, there'll be trouble.</b>

12:48.120 --> 12:49.830
<b>All I'd have to do is slash them.</b>

12:51.790 --> 12:53.000
<b>Understood.</b>

12:56.560 --> 12:59.000
<b>HOLY LIGHT CANDY</b>

12:57.210 --> 12:59.000
<b>I'd like some Holy Light Candy, please.</b>

12:59.250 --> 13:02.130
<b>Oh, sorry, young lady.
I'm all sold out.</b>

13:02.550 --> 13:04.050
<b>What... you're joking.</b>

13:04.050 --> 13:06.140
<b>Sorry. Come back tomorrow, all right?</b>

13:07.640 --> 13:09.560
<b>If he's all out,
then there's nothing to be done.</b>

13:09.560 --> 13:10.430
<b>Come on, we're leaving.</b>

13:10.430 --> 13:13.730
<b>If you'd only run,
I might've been able to buy some!</b>

13:13.730 --> 13:17.650
<b>My apologies.
I put my bodyguard duties first.</b>

13:17.650 --> 13:20.940
<b>But Tithi's looking forward to their souvenirs.</b>

13:20.940 --> 13:24.780
<b>My apologies.
I put my bodyguard duties first.</b>

13:24.780 --> 13:26.700
<b>Dummy! Shin, you dummy!</b>

13:26.700 --> 13:30.660
<b>My apologies.
I put my bodyguard duties first.</b>

13:33.040 --> 13:36.870
<b>My apologies.
I put my bodyguard duties first.</b>

13:37.120 --> 13:40.750
<b>I don't know why, but they seem
to have grown close along the way.</b>

13:40.750 --> 13:41.800
<b>You think so?</b>

13:44.840 --> 13:46.340
<b>Um...</b>

13:48.430 --> 13:50.180
<b>You can have these.</b>

13:50.180 --> 13:52.680
<b>What? But these are yours, aren't they?</b>

13:52.680 --> 13:55.060
<b>It's all right.
We got one extra for free.</b>

13:55.350 --> 13:56.640
<b>We have more than we can eat.</b>

13:59.270 --> 14:00.900
<b>Thank you!</b>

14:01.270 --> 14:02.980
<b>Then... as my way of thanking you...</b>

14:02.980 --> 14:04.360
<b>I'll give you some cookies.</b>

14:06.450 --> 14:08.780
<b>Thank you... very much.</b>

14:09.070 --> 14:10.620
<b>You're welcome.</b>

14:12.280 --> 14:15.580
<b>- Are you done fighting?
- What?</b>

14:16.960 --> 14:20.420
<b>Oh, he and I are actually good friends.</b>

14:20.420 --> 14:21.590
<b>Is that right?</b>

14:22.290 --> 14:26.840
<b>Shin. You and I are good friends.
That's an order, understand?</b>

14:26.840 --> 14:29.050
<b>If you want to guard me,
you have to protect me.</b>

14:29.050 --> 14:30.260
<b>Understood.</b>

14:31.800 --> 14:33.810
<b>She and I are good friends.</b>

14:35.520 --> 14:37.310
<b>I'm glad to hear it.</b>

14:37.600 --> 14:39.850
<b>Bye now.
Thanks for the candy!</b>

14:43.650 --> 14:46.860
<b>Zeshia. Good for you for speaking up.
I'm proud of you!</b>

14:46.860 --> 14:49.320
<b>I... did my best.</b>

14:49.990 --> 14:51.660
<b>Those two are Leno and Shin.</b>

14:51.950 --> 14:55.080
<b>What? Now that you mention it, that mask...</b>

14:55.080 --> 14:58.660
<b>We're going after them.
But don't get too close to them.</b>

14:58.660 --> 15:00.500
<b>Or Shin will slice off your head.</b>

15:02.080 --> 15:04.920
<b>Are all of your subordinates like that?</b>

15:04.920 --> 15:05.800
<b>Like what?</b>

15:05.800 --> 15:08.880
<b>I mean, it doesn't seem easy
to get through to them.</b>

15:08.880 --> 15:12.760
<b>Shin is rather offbeat.
Though, he's not a bad guy.</b>

15:12.760 --> 15:14.930
<b>He's just a little inflexible.</b>

15:14.930 --> 15:16.390
<b>Just a little. Right...</b>

15:17.060 --> 15:20.770
<b>Lena. That masked man
is probably the Spirit King.</b>

15:20.770 --> 15:22.350
<b>Do you remember anything about him?</b>

15:22.520 --> 15:23.480
<b>What?</b>

15:24.270 --> 15:27.360
<b>I can't really say for sure yet.</b>

15:27.360 --> 15:31.070
<b>But... I have a feeling
that something's about to happen.</b>

15:32.700 --> 15:34.660
<b>And not anything good.</b>

15:46.170 --> 15:47.380
<b>We're back now.</b>

15:48.010 --> 15:48.760
<b>Yes.</b>

16:03.230 --> 16:04.440
<b>I just have to throw it?</b>

16:04.440 --> 16:05.190
<b>Yes.</b>

16:14.110 --> 16:15.280
<b>We're back!</b>

16:15.620 --> 16:17.700
<b>Tithi! I have a present for you!</b>

16:20.540 --> 16:21.910
<b>Bad news, bad news!</b>

16:21.910 --> 16:22.620
<b>What's wrong?</b>

16:22.750 --> 16:24.580
<b>The Spirits are going to get eaten up!</b>

16:24.580 --> 16:26.710
<b>The forest is going to dry up!</b>

16:28.300 --> 16:29.800
<b>The Divine Beast Gwen.</b>

16:30.380 --> 16:33.380
<b><i>What's up with those things?
Did they climb over the wall to get in?</i></b>

16:33.760 --> 16:37.810
<b><i>Those are divine hunting dogs,
but they aren't capable of that.</i></b>

16:37.810 --> 16:39.270
<b><i>Anos... they're looking...</i></b>

16:39.310 --> 16:40.520
<b>I'm so scared!</b>

16:40.520 --> 16:41.730
<b>We're surrounded!</b>

16:42.140 --> 16:44.020
<b>They're going to eat us up!</b>

16:44.020 --> 16:45.440
<b>Please step back.</b>

16:47.190 --> 16:49.780
<b>They're just small fry
that Shin's going to slay anyway.</b>

16:50.230 --> 16:52.400
<b>If we wipe them out quietly,
there should be no problem.</b>

16:52.400 --> 16:55.610
<b>I can't cast a spell that intricate.</b>

16:55.610 --> 16:56.370
<b>I'll show you how.</b>

16:56.620 --> 16:57.700
<b>What?</b>

17:09.210 --> 17:10.500
<b><i>Sasha?</i></b>

17:10.500 --> 17:11.920
<b><i>S-Sorry!</i></b>

17:15.510 --> 17:17.340
<b>Who's there?</b>

17:19.470 --> 17:21.640
<b>This is the Forest of the Great Spirit.</b>

17:21.640 --> 17:23.850
<b>You can't hide from me!</b>

17:24.230 --> 17:27.060
<b><i>Wh-What should I do?
The past will be—</i></b>

17:27.060 --> 17:33.070
<b><i>No, good job. To get to the truth, it's better
that you come right out and show yourself.</i></b>

17:33.190 --> 17:36.160
<b><i>Come right out?
I'm totally going to get made!</i></b>

17:36.160 --> 17:40.240
<b><i>Your Source will be hidden.
Just pretend to be a random passerby.</i></b>

17:40.240 --> 17:42.080
<b><i>A passerby...</i></b>

17:43.450 --> 17:45.120
<b>I'm not hostile.</b>

17:45.540 --> 17:48.080
<b>Allow me to show myself now.</b>

17:49.040 --> 17:50.090
<b>Who are you?</b>

17:52.760 --> 17:54.470
<b>My name is Anoshu.</b>

17:55.050 --> 17:56.720
<b>Anoshu Polticoal.</b>

17:59.430 --> 18:00.930
<b>Anoshu?</b>

18:02.430 --> 18:03.220
<b>What?</b>

18:06.730 --> 18:09.690
<b>Demons?
Are you Anos's subordinates?</b>

18:09.690 --> 18:12.070
<b>No, we are a troupe
of traveling entertainers.</b>

18:12.360 --> 18:13.860
<b>Traveling entertainers?</b>

18:15.690 --> 18:17.240
<b>Oh, I know you.</b>

18:17.740 --> 18:18.910
<b>Really?</b>

18:18.910 --> 18:20.990
<b>Yes. Show them, Sasha.</b>

18:20.990 --> 18:22.200
<b>Show them what?</b>

18:22.870 --> 18:27.870
<b>Right, you have a whole bag of tricks.
I don't blame you for asking what.</b>

18:27.870 --> 18:29.330
<b>You know, your surefire hit!</b>

18:29.330 --> 18:32.460
<b>A-All right, all right!
I'll show them!</b>

18:32.880 --> 18:34.050
<b>My impression...</b>

18:34.510 --> 18:36.470
<b>...of the Demon King of Tyranny's eyes!</b>

18:41.390 --> 18:42.180
<b>It worked!</b>

18:42.180 --> 18:45.930
<b>Really, what was that?
You looked just like the Demon King Anos.</b>

18:46.230 --> 18:50.600
<b>Come to think of it, Anoshu, you do kind
of look like the Demon King Anos.</b>

18:50.600 --> 18:52.230
<b>You did well to notice that.</b>

18:52.230 --> 18:55.150
<b>I am the Demon King of Tyranny as a young boy.</b>

18:55.780 --> 18:59.280
<b>Just because I'm a child,
did you think I wasn't the Demon King?</b>

19:04.030 --> 19:07.450
<b>That was spot on!
I can really imagine him saying that!</b>

19:07.870 --> 19:09.960
<b>But what are you doing here?</b>

19:10.080 --> 19:13.710
<b>And no ordinary Demons could
have climbed over that wall.</b>

19:13.960 --> 19:18.920
<b>I had her breach the wall.
To survive in this era as a traveling entertainer,</b>

19:18.920 --> 19:21.050
<b>a certain amount of power is necessary.</b>

19:21.050 --> 19:24.930
<b>I'm a traveling entertainer
who's stronger than the Four Evil Royals.</b>

19:26.640 --> 19:30.900
<b>What do you think, Shin?
They don't seem to be sketchy, do they?</b>

19:31.480 --> 19:35.150
<b>I'm Anoshu Polticoal.
Just a traveling entertainer.</b>

19:35.480 --> 19:39.400
<b>He's Anoshu Polticoal.
Just a traveling entertainer.</b>

19:39.700 --> 19:42.070
<b>What? You've met him before?</b>

19:42.070 --> 19:42.870
<b>Yes.</b>

19:44.030 --> 19:46.870
<b>A troupe of Demons, Humans,
and Spirits, huh?</b>

19:46.870 --> 19:48.750
<b>What a strange combination!</b>

19:48.750 --> 19:53.000
<b>Laughter knows no borders.
The gap between species is a trivial matter.</b>

19:53.210 --> 19:56.550
<b>Oh, right... you know what, I like that.</b>

19:56.550 --> 19:58.960
<b>If only that would become the norm in this world.</b>

19:59.760 --> 20:03.010
<b>So what business do you have in Aharthern?</b>

20:03.300 --> 20:05.760
<b>I'd like to do some research on Spirits.</b>

20:06.260 --> 20:07.100
<b>Lena?</b>

20:08.350 --> 20:12.770
<b>She's a member of our troupe,
but a rather strange one at that, with amnesia.</b>

20:12.770 --> 20:16.610
<b>I'm told that the Great Spirit Leno
is the mother of all Spirits.</b>

20:16.610 --> 20:17.940
<b>Do you know anything about her?</b>

20:19.690 --> 20:22.860
<b>I've never seen this child before.
You have no memories?</b>

20:22.860 --> 20:23.990
<b>Mm-hmm.</b>

20:23.990 --> 20:26.330
<b>Hmm... I have no idea.</b>

20:26.330 --> 20:27.540
<b>Not even you?</b>

20:27.540 --> 20:32.370
<b>It's not like even the mother of all Spirits has
a full grasp on every single Spirit, you know.</b>

20:32.580 --> 20:36.920
<b>I see. But it seems that Lena
has some kind of memory of this place.</b>

20:37.130 --> 20:40.090
<b>If you don't mind,
we'd like to stay here a while.</b>

20:40.090 --> 20:42.380
<b>Of course, you may stay
as long as you like.</b>

20:42.680 --> 20:46.260
<b>But first, can I talk
to you for a minute?</b>

20:46.260 --> 20:47.010
<b>Sure.</b>

20:49.100 --> 20:52.520
<b>That girl named Lena...
She's the Love Fairy Fran.</b>

20:52.770 --> 20:57.770
<b>Fran? The Spirit who gives shape
to unrequited love, and brings people together?</b>

20:57.770 --> 20:59.820
<b>You're a Demon and you know about her?</b>

20:59.820 --> 21:03.150
<b>I once studied about her under
a Spirit's tutelage.</b>

21:03.150 --> 21:06.200
<b>But why did you pretend not
to know her just now?</b>

21:06.490 --> 21:10.490
<b>The Love Fairy Fran wanders
about seeking her memories.</b>

21:10.490 --> 21:13.710
<b>If she realizes that she's the Love Fairy,
she'll vanish—that's why.</b>

21:13.710 --> 21:15.670
<b>So don't ever tell her who she is.</b>

21:15.670 --> 21:18.540
<b>We need to make her remember love first—</b>

21:19.550 --> 21:20.920
<b>Wh-What's going on?</b>

21:24.010 --> 21:25.930
<b>Where on earth were they hiding?</b>

21:31.600 --> 21:33.600
<b><i>Anos! I can't draw my sword!</i></b>

21:33.600 --> 21:37.560
<b><i>I forgot to mention that we cannot
bring any magical tools into the past.</i></b>

21:38.440 --> 21:40.690
<b><i>Well, that's... gonna be a problem.</i></b>

21:40.690 --> 21:42.360
<b><i>No worries, there's a sword for you.</i></b>

21:42.940 --> 21:45.530
<b>Produce the Unique Sword Sigshesta.</b>

21:45.530 --> 21:48.200
<b>It's not a sword that I can lend
to a mere traveling entertainer.</b>

21:48.490 --> 21:50.830
<b>Don't be like that right now!</b>

21:50.830 --> 21:52.790
<b>Bring it out!
This Unique Sword thing!</b>

21:55.000 --> 21:58.750
<b>I have never seen anyone able
to wield it besides myself an my lord.</b>

21:58.920 --> 22:01.500
<b>Then that man will be the third.</b>

22:02.250 --> 22:03.300
<b>Lay.</b>

22:03.760 --> 22:05.260
<b>Right here, Sigshesta!</b>

22:11.060 --> 22:12.350
<b>Amazing!</b>

22:12.720 --> 22:14.810
<b>I owe you one. Thanks.</b>

22:14.810 --> 22:19.650
<b>Why didn't you take part in
the Great War when you have such skills?</b>

22:19.650 --> 22:22.360
<b>I like swords,
but I hate war.</b>

22:23.690 --> 22:27.490
<b>I shall lend you that sword
for as long as you're here.</b>

22:30.570 --> 22:34.080
<b>The price will be to graze me with it.</b>
